proval.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:196px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">03</span></div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:auto\">Supporter</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Benefits and pricing pending approval.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:196px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">04</span></div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:auto\">Educator &amp; Coach</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Benefits and pricing pending approval.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:196px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">05</span></div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:auto\">Corporate &amp; Community Partner</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Benefits and pricing pending approval.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e0662725","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.pillars","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"bbda4258","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"membership.pillars\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">The four pillars</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">A membership built on four pillars.</h2>\n    <p class=\"body-lg muted\">Every AFSVHCL membership is designed to deliver value across community, commerce, education and measurable social impact.</p>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--4\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"6.4\" r=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"5.4\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18.6\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7.6 20.4v-2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 8.8 0v2.6\"/><path d=\"M2.2 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.8-2.8M21.8 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 0-4.8-2.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Community</h3>\n      <p>Belonging, local chapters, events, volunteer opportunities and a global network committed to youth development and inclusion.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.6 12.4V4.4a.8.8 0 0 1 .8-.8h8l8 8-8.8 8.8z\"/><circle cx=\"8.2\" cy=\"8.2\" r=\"1.6\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Marketplace</h3>\n      <p>Member pricing, exclusive drops, partner offers and early access to premium AFSVHCL merchandise and athlete gear.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 6.6C9.8 5 6.6 4.6 3.4 5v13.4c3.2-.4 6.4 0 8.6 1.6 2.2-1.6 5.4-2 8.6-1.6V5c-3.2-.4-6.4 0-8.6 1.6z\"/><path d=\"M12 6.6v13.4\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.4c.6-1 2.4-.8 2.4.6 0 1.2-2.4 2.6-2.4 2.6s-2.4-1.4-2.4-2.6c0-1.4 1.8-1.6 2.4-.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Education &amp; neurodivergent support</h3>\n      <p>A virtual learning hub, parent resources, career readiness and wellness content through AFSVHCL, MLMSR and vetted partners.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.6 20.4h16.8\"/><rect x=\"5.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6.4\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"10.6\" y=\"7.6\" width=\"3\" height=\"10.8\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14.4\" rx=\".6\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Impact &amp; recognition</h3>\n      <p>Annual reporting, recognition designations and measurable outcomes showing the real-world impact of your membership.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"d104d93a","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.tiers","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"94a9c1eb","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" id=\"tiers\" data-el=\"membership.tiers\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Membership</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Become an AFSV VRC member.</h2>\n    <p class=\"body-lg muted\">Membership isn’t open yet. Pre-register now and we’ll email you the moment it goes live — no payment, no commitment.</p>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"tiers2\" data-stagger>\n      <article class=\"tier2\">\n        <div class=\"tier2__top\"><h3>Community Membership</h3><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Opening soon</span></div>\n        <p class=\"tier2__for\">For individuals</p>\n        <p class=\"tier2__price tier2__price--soon\"><b>Pre-register</b> <span>We’ll email you when it opens</span></p>\n        <details class=\"tier2__group\" open><summary>Community<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Digital membership card + member badge (in-app)</li><li>Welcome certificate</li><li>Access to member community platform</li><li>Local chapter events (as available)</li><li>Volunteer and opportunity board</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Marketplace<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>10–15% member pricing on purchases</li><li>Early access to new merchandise drops</li><li>Exclusive limited edition access</li><li>Member-only flash sales</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Education &amp; neurodivergent support<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Family Learning Hub (virtual): resource library, parent webinars</li><li>Career readiness, financial literacy, entrepreneurship</li><li>Mental wellness resources</li><li>Virtual fitness &amp; community challenges</li><li>Sports development &amp; nutrition content</li><li>Youth athlete resources</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Impact &amp; recognition<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Annual member-facing Impact Report</li><li>Founding member recognition window (time-limited)</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Welcome package<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Premium AFSVHCL branded hoodie</li><li>Digital membership card</li><li>Welcome certificate</li><li>Exclusive member badge in app</li></ul></details>\n        <a class=\"btn btn--navy\" href=\"{{url:/become-a-member/}}\">Become a member</a>\n      </article><article class=\"tier2 tier2--hot\">\n        <div class=\"tier2__top\"><h3>Community Business Membership</h3><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Opening soon</span></div>\n        <p class=\"tier2__for\">For businesses, professional firms and community organizations</p>\n        <p class=\"tier2__price tier2__price--soon\"><b>Pre-register</b> <span>We’ll email you when it opens</span></p>\n        <details class=\"tier2__group\" open><summary>Marketplace &amp; distribution<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Preferred listing in the AFSVHCL Marketplace Directory (web + app)</li><li>Member exposure across Canada, USA, the Caribbean and the global diaspora</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Marketing<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Business profile page</li><li>Member spotlight features</li><li>Marketplace promotion opportunities</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Recruitment &amp; inclusion<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Access to neurodivergent employment initiatives</li><li>Internship opportunities</li><li>Student placement programs</li><li>Volunteer recruitment channel</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>Impact &amp; recognition<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Community Impact Certificate</li><li>Annual recognition listing</li><li>Inclusion Champion designation</li><li>Awards program participation</li></ul></details><details class=\"tier2__group\"><summary>First access: sponsorship<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Event sponsorships</li><li>Sports programs</li><li>Esports initiatives</li><li>Educational programs</li><li>Neurodivergent support programs</li></ul></details>\n        <a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/become-a-member/}}\">Become a member</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a87ad047","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.premium","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"5730bd60","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"membership.premium\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Benefits for all members</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Premium community experiences.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--3\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M8.2 15.8a5.4 5.4 0 0 1 0-7.6M15.8 8.2a5.4 5.4 0 0 1 0 7.6M5.4 18.6a9.4 9.4 0 0 1 0-13.2M18.6 5.4a9.4 9.4 0 0 1 0 13.2\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Monthly virtual events</h3>\n      \n      <ul class=\"kcard__list\"><li>Business development sessions</li><li>Entrepreneurship workshops</li><li>Wellness &amp; mental health</li><li>Education &amp; neurodiversity awareness</li><li>Sports leadership talks</li></ul>\n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M3.4 12h17.2\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.2 3.6 8.6s-1.2 6.2-3.6 8.6c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.2-3.6-8.6s1.2-6.2 3.6-8.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Annual Global Summit</h3>\n      \n      <ul class=\"kcard__list\"><li>Reduced registration fees</li><li>Priority access to sessions</li><li>VIP networking opportunities</li><li>Meet community leaders &amp; athletes</li><li>Exclusive summit merchandise</li></ul>\n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3.4l2.6 5.4 5.8.8-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.8l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8-4.2-4.1 5.8-.8z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Community Rewards Program</h3>\n      <p>Earn points for referrals, volunteering, purchases and event participation. Redeem for:</p>\n      <ul class=\"kcard__list\"><li>Merchandise &amp; gear</li><li>Event tickets</li><li>Membership renewals</li><li>Partner discounts</li></ul>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"5fc149ca","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.fund","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"38e75b24","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--navy fund\" data-el=\"membership.fund\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"fund__grid\">\n      <div class=\"reveal\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund</p>\n        <h2 class=\"h2 mb-m\">Every membership changes a life.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead mb-l\">A fixed amount from every membership is proposed for a dedicated Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund — measured and reported annually.</p>\n        <div class=\"coins\">\n          <div class=\"coin\"><b>Every</b><span>individual membership</span><em>gives back</em></div>\n          <div class=\"coin coin--gold\"><b>Every</b><span>business membership</span><em>gives more</em></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"fund__fine\">Fund allocation will be published in the Annual Impact Report. <a href=\"{{url:/impact/}}\">See our impact framework →</a></p>\n      </div>\n      \n  <div class=\"orbit\" data-stagger>\n    <div class=\"orbit__core\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Neurodivergent</span><b>Inclusion Fund</b><small>Measured &amp; reported annually</small></div>\n    <div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:0\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M9.4 4.2a3.4 3.4 0 0 0-3.4 3.2 3.2 3.2 0 0 0-1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 0 3 4.8 3 3 0 0 0 4.6 1.6V5.6a2.6 2.6 0 0 0-2.6-1.4z\"/><path d=\"M14.6 4.2A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 18 7.4a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 1-3 4.8 3 3 0 0 1-4.6 1.6\"/><path d=\"M9 10.2c1 .2 1.8.9 2.1 1.8M15 10.2c-1 .2-1.8.9-2.1 1.8\"/></svg></span><b>Assessments</b><small>Diagnostic assessments for neurodivergent youth and families.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:1\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 6.6C9.8 5 6.6 4.6 3.4 5v13.4c3.2-.4 6.4 0 8.6 1.6 2.2-1.6 5.4-2 8.6-1.6V5c-3.2-.4-6.4 0-8.6 1.6z\"/><path d=\"M12 6.6v13.4\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.4c.6-1 2.4-.8 2.4.6 0 1.2-2.4 2.6-2.4 2.6s-2.4-1.4-2.4-2.6c0-1.4 1.8-1.6 2.4-.6z\"/></svg></span><b>Tutoring &amp; Education</b><small>Specialized tutoring and academic support programs.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:2\"><span><