Beijing</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇬🇭</span>Accra</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇦🇪</span>Dubai</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇰🇪</span>Nairobi</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇯🇲</span>Kingston</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇧🇷</span>São Paulo</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇵🇭</span>Manila</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇮🇳</span>Mumbai</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇳🇬</span>Lagos</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇬🇧</span>London</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇺🇸</span>Houston</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇺🇸</span>Atlanta</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇺🇸</span>Orlando</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇺🇸</span>Miami</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇺🇸</span>New York</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇦</span>Calgary</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇦</span>Montreal</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇦</span>Vancouver</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇦</span>Toronto</li></ul>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"bd536f58","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.targets","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"3fee2b36","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"membership.targets\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Five-year community targets</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Aspirational growth goals.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"xstats\" data-stagger>\n    <div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"100000\">100,000</span></b>\n      <span>Individual members</span>\n      \n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"10000\">10,000</span></b>\n      <span>Business members</span>\n      \n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"30\">30</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Countries represented</span>\n      \n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"25000\">25,000</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Families supported</span>\n      \n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"10000\">10,000</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Neurodivergent youth supported</span>\n      \n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"10000\">10,000</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Businesses engaged</span>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"xstats__note\">Targets are aspirational and subject to partner capacity, funding and program rollout timelines. Actual results may differ materially.</p>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"7b93de5c","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.faq","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"fa94500e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"membership.faq\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section faqwrap\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Frequently asked questions</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Membership FAQ.</h2></div>\n    \n  <div class=\"xfaq\">\n    <details class=\"xfaq__item\" open><summary>When can I join?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Membership isn’t open yet. Pre-register on the Become a Member page and we’ll email you as soon as it goes live, with everything you need to join. Pre-registering is free and there’s no commitment.</p></details><details class=\"xfaq__item\"><summary>What happens to the Inclusion Fund?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>AFSVHCL proposes to commit a share of every individual and business membership to a dedicated Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund supporting assessments, tutoring, employment readiness, assistive technology, family support services and scholarships. Allocation would be measured and reported annually.</p></details><details class=\"xfaq__item\"><summary>How do I redeem rewards?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>The proposed Community Rewards Program lets members earn points for referrals, volunteering, purchases and event participation, redeemable for merchandise, event tickets, membership renewals and partner discounts. Full details will be shared at program launch.</p></details><details class=\"xfaq__item\"><summary>Can I upgrade from Individual to Business?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Yes. When the program launches, individual members will be able to upgrade to a business membership.</p></details><details class=\"xfaq__item\"><summary>What if I’m outside Canada?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Membership is planned to be open to individuals and businesses worldwide. Digital benefits, the learning hub, virtual events and the community platform are accessible globally; physical benefits such as local chapter events and merchandise shipping may vary by location.</p></details><details class=\"xfaq__item\"><summary>Which currency should I choose?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Whichever works best for you. USD and CAD pricing are planned to be equivalent based on current exchange rates, and you would choose your currency at checkout.</p></details>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"5a0d146b","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"membership.form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"99b993a4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section \" id=\"membership-form\" data-el=\"membership.form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Keep up to date.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">This is not a purchase. Membership details, benefits and launch timing will be shared as they are approved.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Accommodation requests are optional and free-text. Please do not include a diagnosis or medical records.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f24\">First name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f24\" name=\"first-name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" aria-describedby=\"f24-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f24-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f25\">Last name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f25\" name=\"last-name\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" aria-describedby=\"f25-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f25-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f26\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f26\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f26-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f26-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f27\">Mobile <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"f27\" name=\"mobile\" autocomplete=\"tel\" aria-describedby=\"f27-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f27-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f28\">City or region<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f28\" name=\"city-or-region\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\" aria-describedby=\"f28-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f28-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f29\">Country<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f29\" name=\"country\" autocomplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"f29-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f29-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f30\">Membership pathway<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f30\" name=\"membership-pathway\" aria-describedby=\"f30-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Select a pathway</option><option value=\"Athlete\">Athlete</option><option value=\"Family\">Family</option><option value=\"Supporter\">Supporter</option><option value=\"Educator &amp; Coach\">Educator &amp; Coach</option><option value=\"Corporate &amp; Community Partner\">Corporate &amp; Community Partner</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f30-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f31\">Sports or interests <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f31\" name=\"sports-or-interests\" aria-describedby=\"f31-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f31-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f32\">Age group <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f32\" name=\"age-group\" aria-describedby=\"f32-err\"><option value=\"\">Prefer not to say</option><option value=\"Under 18\">Under 18</option><option value=\"18–24\">18–24</option><option value=\"25–39\">25–39</option><option value=\"40–59\">40–59</option><option value=\"60+\">60+</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f32-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f33\">Preferred communication channel<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f33\" name=\"preferred-communication-channel\" aria-describedby=\"f33-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Select a channel</option><option value=\"Email\">Email</option><option value=\"Phone\">Phone</option><option value=\"Text message\">Text message</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f33-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f34\">Accessibility or accommodation request <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f34\" name=\"accessibility-or-accommodation-request\" aria-describedby=\"f34-err\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"\"></textarea>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f34-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div></div>\n  <label class=\"check\" for=\"f23\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f23\" name=\"consent\" required aria-describedby=\"f23-err\"><span>I agree to receive membership updates from AFSV VRC. You can unsubscribe at any time.<span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f23-err\"></span></span></label>\n  <div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden><strong>Thank you for joining the AFSV VRC interest list.</strong>We will share membership details, benefits and launch timing as they are approved.</div>\n  <div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--navy\">Keep Up to Date<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</form>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}